20,"products":21},"30 Early-20s Shoe Ideas for Everyday Style","Thirty shoes that carry a whole early-twenties wardrobe — ballet flats, chunky loafers, low-top sneakers and the boots worth the money.","shoes",["Date","2026-08-11T00:00:00.000Z"],"__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/pin-early-20s-shoes.jpg","Collage flyer of thirty shoe styles for early twenties outfits",false,[22,28,34,40,45,51],{"name":23,"note":24,"image":25,"alt":26,"url":27},"Square-toe ballet flats","The pair that makes jeans look deliberate.","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-01.jpg","Black square-toe ballet flats on a linen background","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE1",{"name":29,"note":30,"image":31,"alt":32,"url":33},"Chunky lug-sole loafers","Wears with tights in winter, bare ankles in spring.","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-02.jpg","Brown lug-sole loafers photographed from above","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE2",{"name":35,"note":36,"image":37,"alt":38,"url":39},"Low-top leather sneakers","Goes with everything, ages well, forgives a lot.","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-03.jpg","White low-top leather sneakers side view","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE3",{"name":41,"image":42,"alt":43,"url":44},"Slouchy knee-high boots","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-04.jpg","Tan slouchy knee-high leather boots","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE4",{"name":46,"note":47,"image":48,"alt":49,"url":50},"Strappy block-sandal heels","Block heel, so you can actually stand in them all night.","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-05.jpg","Nude strappy sandals with a block heel","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE5",{"name":52,"image":53,"alt":54,"url":55},"Mesh flats with an ankle strap","__ASTRO_IMAGE_./images/shoe-06.jpg","Black mesh flats with a thin ankle strap","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE6","Early twenties is when a shoe collection stops being whatever was on sale and\nstarts being a set of decisions. These thirty cover the ground: something flat\nfor long days, something with a heel that doesn't punish you, and two pairs of\nboots that will still look right in five years.","src/content/roundups/30-early-20s-shoe-fashion.md",[59,60,61,62,63,64,65],"./images/pin-early-20s-shoes.jpg","./images/shoe-01.jpg","./images/shoe-02.jpg","./images/shoe-03.jpg","./images/shoe-04.jpg","./images/shoe-05.jpg","./images/shoe-06.jpg","22a7d1365c42b00e",{"html":68,"metadata":69},"\u003Cp>Early twenties is when a shoe collection stops being whatever was on sale and\nstarts being a set of decisions. These thirty cover the ground: something flat\nfor long days, something with a heel that doesn’t punish you, and two pairs of\nboots that will still look right in five years.\u003C/p>",{"headings":70,"localImagePaths":71,"remoteImagePaths":72,"frontmatter":73,"imagePaths":82},[],[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"category":16,"pubDate":74,"pinImage":59,"pinAlt":19,"products":75},["Date","2026-08-11T00:00:00.000Z"],[76,77,78,79,80,81],{"name":23,"note":24,"image":60,"alt":26,"url":27},{"name":29,"note":30,"image":61,"alt":32,"url":33},{"name":35,"note":36,"image":62,"alt":38,"url":39},{"name":41,"image":63,"alt":43,"url":44},{"name":46,"note":47,"image":64,"alt":49,"url":50},{"name":52,"image":65,"alt":54,"url":55},[]]